        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Music: \"Arabesque\" by my 1984 band Débris, which consisted of me on bass, and Jean-Martin Mignault on electronic drums. Graffiti artist Zilon does the Arabic chanting"
